flowchart TB
    subgraph Sources[Commerce Sources]
      Shopify[Shopify Admin API]
      MySQL[MySQL Item / Store]
      Behavior[Web / App Behavior]
    end

    Shopify --> ApiObs[GraphQL Observation Ingestion]
    MySQL --> CDC[Flink CDC / Changelog]
    Behavior --> Kafka[Kafka] --> Stream[PyFlink Event-Time Processing]

    ApiObs --> Iceberg[(Iceberg + Polaris)]
    CDC --> Iceberg
    Stream --> Iceberg

    Iceberg --> dbt[dbt Marts<br/>Business Facts / State / Entity]
    dbt --> MF[MetricFlow<br/>Metric Authority]

    MF --> Agent[Governed Data Agent<br/>Q&A / Comparison / Attribution / Diagnosis]
    MF --> Contract[Fixed Serving Contract]
    Contract --> Dagster[Dagster Export Orchestration]
    Dagster --> Serving[(Iceberg Serving Tables)]
    Serving --> Trino[Trino<br/>Serving Query Engine]
    Trino --> BI[BI / Dashboard]
    Trino --> API[FastAPI<br/>Stable Business API]
    API --> Apps[Business Apps]

    dbt --> DataHub[DataHub<br/>Governance Context]
    Dagster --> Runtime[Runtime / Recovery Evidence]
    Dagster -. DataFlow / DataJob Lineage .-> DataHub
    Serving -. Serving Dataset Governance .-> DataHub
    BI -. Dashboard Lineage .-> DataHub
    API -. OpenAPI Endpoint Metadata .-> DataHub
    DataHub --> Agent
    Runtime --> Agent

    Docs[Governed Knowledge Corpus] --> RAG[Knowledge RAG]
    RAG --> Agent

    Agent --> MCP[MCP Runtime<br/>Authority-preserving Adapter]
